Package: phenoloom
Type: Package
Title: CTTIR Spatial Biology Suite
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: An installation framework for the CTTIR spatial biology suite.
    Declares 'segmantR', 'cellspecR', 'gatekeepR', and 'phenoscapR' as required
    dependencies so that standard package installation installs the suite
    and its required dependencies. Analysis functionality remains in the
    member packages; no additional functions or automatic attachment are
    provided.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/phenoloom
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/phenoloom/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    segmantR,
    cellspecR,
    gatekeepR,
    phenoscapR
Remotes:
    CTTIR/segmantR,
    CTTIR/cellspecR,
    CTTIR/gatekeepR,
    CTTIR/phenoscapR
Additional_repositories: https://cttir.r-universe.dev
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
